  "source": "流畅（4×4 超胞合并）",
  "translation": "Fluid (4×4 supercell binning)"
 },
 {
  "context": "SettingsDialog",
  "source": "只影响连续采集时的实时预览：屏上一个像素是若干个 2x2 偏振超胞的平均，越流畅合并得越多。\n单帧拍摄、打开图库/文件、停止后的显示与所有保存、导出不受影响，始终按全分辨率解算。\n自动挡按窗口大小决定：放大到源图装得下就回到全分辨率。",
  "translation": "Affects the live preview during continuous capture only: one pixel on screen is the average of several 2x2 polarization supercells, and the smoother the setting, the more is binned.\nSingle-frame capture, the gallery, saved files, the display after stopping, and every export are unaffected and always solve at full resolution.\nAutomatic follows the window size: once the source image fits on screen it returns to full resolution."
 },
